# ---- secret envelope hub token (bin/secrets-apply.sh, BH-7964, BH-7965) ----
# Hub only; same value as the jobs worker secret ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN
# (`wrangler secret put ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN --name harness-jobs`). It gates the
# envelope read, the pending list, the confirm and the public-key write. The
# console proxy never holds it. Unset on the hub = the secrets-apply lane logs
# one line and does nothing. Unset on the worker = those routes answer 503.
#ENVELOPE_HUB_TOKEN=
